      "en": "Isaiah is very bold and says, “I was found by those who didn’t seek me. I was revealed to those who didn’t ask for me.”",
      "ko": "또한 이사야가 매우 담대하여 이르되 내가 구하지 아니하는 자들에게 찾은바 되고 내게 문의하지 아니하는 자들에게 나타났노라 하였고",
      "source_text_hash": "97496c760bfd7cbecdf96ab5c38ee6f282f63065b965e03a40c5b1738543f407",
      "translation_text_hash": "7cb1b347b5e11bb4dae7b4b23ced8b89a390c66457eb68321f099e40499d18be",
